window.products.push({"id":356005,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 1 lb Tumbled Dragon Blood Stones from Africa - 0.40\" to 0.60\" avg. - Bulk Natural Polished Gemstone Supplies for Crafts, Reiki, Cr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ip8ovVcaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fantasia is a USA based mining company located in Massillon Ohio. The Fantasia brand of Dragon Blood tumbled stones you are ordering are 100% natural and begin with \"A\" to \"AA\" grade rough. These premium rough stones are then tumbled using Fantasia's proprietary tumbling techniques which bring out the naturally beautiful colors, shine, luster and energy in every stone. Your order will contain multiple pieces of these stones with varying natural sizes, shapes and patterns as shown in the images which is equal to or greater than the total weight purchased. In most cases the size of each stone is between 0.40\" to 0.60\" each, but it is possible to get some stones smaller or larger than these averages in your order.VERY IMPORTANT: With all tumbled stones there are some material types which will have imperfections even after being meticulously tumbled due to their natural characteristics. While rare, due to the fragile nature of tumbled stones it is also possible minor chipping may be found on some of the stones received. The number of acceptable imperfections is relative to the material type and the grade being purchased and some minor imperfections should be expected as shown in our images.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1ip8ovVcaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B07YSZNW5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSZNW5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSZNW5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":356006,"name":"Mr IRONSTONE Long Clothes Rack, Heavy Duty Clothing Rack with X Base, Garment Rack on Wheels with Brakes, Commercial Clothes Racks for Hanging Clothes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p4id0oPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Unique and Extra Storage Design] Different from other Z rack, our hanging clothes rack adopts an X shape base design to strengthen our weight capacity to hold up to 300 lbs. The dimension of our clothes rack is 63\" L*22\" W*63\" H, which is more large than others to satisfy your storage need. The hanging rack is ideal for small spaces, such as living rooms, laundry rooms, bedrooms, entryways or dormitories. [Durable and Sturdy] Our clothing rack is made of the high-quality frosted iron tube that is built to last. Especially, the bottom crossing design of the garment rack makes it more sturdy and durable to hold up to 300 lbs. The wardrobe rack also comes with premium heavy gauge chromium plating to resist rust and corrosion, making it perfect for damp areas such as your laundry room or closet. It is designed to be sturdy and accommodate your daily and seasonal clothes with ease. [Mobile Rack & Multi-Purpose] Featuring 4 smooth 360-degree Industrial-grade rolling rubber wheels (2 wheels with brakes), it's easy for you to move this rack around whenever needed. You can also lock the rack in place when wanted. Whether you're hanging laundry or storing clothes, rolling clothes rack will make your life much easier. This portable hanging rack organizer can not only be used to store and dry out your clothes on a rainy day but also on a commercial level. You can use it to exhibit your clothes in your clothing store. Get it now if you have many clothes, shoes, and bags! [Easy to Assemble] The closet rack is easy to assemble with easy understanding instructions and the necessary tools we provide. Simply follow all the given instructions and you'll be ready to use it in no time! The buckle design makes the whole process super fast and easy. If having any assembling problems, please contact us at any time. [Friendly Customer Service] The clothes hanger rack has a unique and modern style, and the assembly process is very simple. If having any assembly problems, please feel free to contact us. It provides a 36-month warranty card to solve your problems at once. [Warm Tips]❤ When you assemble the X Base, a connecting piece is assembled inside the supporting bars. If you assemble outside the bars, it will not assemble successfully.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p4id0oPFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr IRONSTONE","source_asin":"B09VBRBHBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VBRBHBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VBRBHBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
