window.products.push({"id":356253,"name":"Alessi \"Diabolix\" Bottle Opener - Thermoplastic Resin, Red. (PRODUCT)RED.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yUwSAq0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Created as part of the F.F.F. (Family Follows Fiction) meta project, an operation in the early 1990s that aimed to explore the affective structure of shapes and objects, starting from the idea of reproducing the object creation process followed by children and primitive cultures. The \"Diabolic\" bottle opener was a great success, perhaps because it married the creative energies of Centro Study Alessi with a traditional object from the Alessi catalogue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yUwSAq0rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alessi","source_asin":"B01B7FXRJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B7FXRJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B7FXRJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":356254,"name":"NEQUARE Placemats for Dining Table, Set of 6 Woven Vinyl Mats Heat Insulation Stain Resistant Non-Slip Washable PVC mats for Kitchen Patio Table Thank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91REthSgzmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Material】NEQUARE placemats are woven by eco-friendly and high-quality Vinyl with the composition of 70% PVC and 30% polyester silk. Double layers cross-weave table mats provide both soft touch feeling and effective heat Insulation. Precise hot cutting craft eliminates the rough selvedge. 【Size&Color】The size of placemats are 18\" x 12\"(45 x 30 cm). Suitable for tables of all sizes and shapes. Due to manual measurement, please allow an error of 1-2 cm. Versatile color to choose from, available in 12 options to suit different occasions. There will be one suitable for you. 【Features】Durable, non-fade and pull force non-deformation due to hard wearing of high-grade vinyl cross construction. Stain-resistant and heat insulated, perfectly protect your dining table from stain or scratch. The uneven surface enhances the ability of anti-skit. Easy to store and could be folded in any shape you want to fit in your cabinet or drawers. 【Decoration】Classic solid color table mats could be a good match with your dining table. The Top-grade exquisite design will add a lively touch to the kitchen table and holiday or party atmosphere, which is a delightful decoration for your home, dining hall, kitchen, hotel and business office, Thanksgiving and Christmas dinner, outside parties. 【Easy care】Please wash them in warm soapy water and dry under the shade after use. If stains are stuck in the placemats, rinse with water and clean with a soft brush. Reusable and always looks brand new after washing. Do not wash in machine or use steel ball as it will shorten the service life of placemats. If there is crease on the placemat, soak it into warm water and take it out, press it with heavy objects, then the crease will disappear. 【Guarantee】NEQUARE is a registered Trademark. Customer satisfaction is our top priority. Please feel free to contact us for any question, our professional customer service team is standing by.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91REthSgzmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEQUARE","source_asin":"B08QS4TT3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QS4TT3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QS4TT3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
