window.products.push({"id":356271,"name":"Bath Mat for Tub, Non Slip Bathtub Mat 28\" X 16\", Shower Mat with Suction Cups Machine Washable Bathtub Mats with Drain Holes (Khaki)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F4kFP1Z-L._AC_.jpg","description":"🛀 Super soft material: The bathtub mat is made of new TPE material, which is softer than PVC, giving you a completely different and wonderful touch, rich colors, making the bathroom more beautiful, you can enjoy a comfortable bath at home 🛀Comfortable massage: the bathtub mat non slip has a cloud pattern design, soft and comfortable, which can massage the soles of your feet , relieve foot fatigue while removing foot dirt 🛀 Double non slip: bathtub mat non slip surface with anti-slip bubbles, anti-slip pattern clear, enhance the friction between the feet and bathtub mat, effectively prevent users from falling down and getting injured due to slippery ground for bathing. At the same time, there are several strong suction cups on the back of the bathtub mat, firmly absorbing the ground, strong anti-slip, protecting you and your family from falling down! 🛀Quick drainage: The bathtub mats has drainage holes, so the foam sewage will not accumulate and can drain quickly, taking away the dirt and allowing you to continue to enjoy a comfortable bathing time 🛀 Easy to clean. The bathtub mat can be rinsed or machine washed, freeing your hands and saving time. You can put it anywhere, you can stick it on the wall and hang it up to dry. Keep the bath mat dry after each use. (Tip. Bathtub non-slip mat can only be attached to a clean and smooth surface, please wipe the bathtub with a damp cloth before use and make sure the bathtub mat has been firmly adhered to the surface before filling with water)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F4kFP1Z-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dishyihrt","source_asin":"B0B4G4VVXF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4G4VVXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4G4VVXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":356272,"name":"House, Home and More Skid-Resistant Carpet Runner - Black - 12 Feet X 27 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":133.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cnfSs-UmL._AC_.jpg","description":"You’ll walk confidently on your new carpet runner from House, Home and More! Thanks to its non-slip rubber backing, this runner won’t bunch up or shift under your feet. Your household will appreciate the added security in your walking spaces, especially older adults. Our carpet runners protect and add comfort to your hardwood or tile floors and help muffle sound throughout your home. WHERE DO RUNNER RUGS GO? Carpet runners are perfect for high-traffic areas like hallways, entryways and kitchens. Furniture isn’t traditionally placed on top of runners. If you’re placing your runner in a hallway with furniture, choose a width that allows you to move the furniture to one side of the hallway without resting on top of the runner. Narrow kitchens are ideal living spaces for runners. Time spent at the stove or cleaning up at the sink is more enjoyable with a carpet runner under your feet. Bringing runners into your bedroom provides warmth and comfort, especially on hard floors. If you’re placing runners at the sides and/or foot of your bed, you want to cover the length of the bed, outside of accent furniture like nightstands. ARE CARPET RUNNERS PET FRIENDLY? Our carpet runners offer stability and a cozy place for your pets to rest. The non-slip backing adds traction and helps to create a secure environment for your dogs, cats and other pets. Walking on slippery wood or tile floors can be cumbersome and frightening for senior dogs and cats. The soft surface of a runner will keep their paws comfy while the added traction allows them to move with confidence. If you have pets, you may want to consider a color or design that won’t showcase their shedding. HOW TO CARE FOR YOUR CARPET RUNNER: Our carpet runners feature a non-slip rubber backing which helps to keep them in place while vacuuming, but can become damaged if put into a washing machine. When your runner needs cleaning, we recommend vacuuming to remove surface dirt and spot cleaning areas that need extra care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cnfSs-UmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"House, Home and More","source_asin":"B004AS96J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004AS96J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004AS96J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
