window.products.push({"id":356454,"name":"DecorShore Mosaic Vase, Floor Vase, 20” Accent Tall Vase, Decorative Metal Mosaic Piece Vase in Geometric Pattern Wavy Shape with Glass Mosaic- Marble","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614rhmamrHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Bella Palacio decorative vase is constructed of durable iron and is covered with turquoise Arabesque-shaped glass mosaic tiles. Each vase is covered with shimmering turquoise & silver tiles and the top rim is hand-painted silver. It is 20 inches tall and 6 inches wide with a tapered base and weighs 6 lbs. Each is handcrafted and contains slight variations & imperfections that are an inherent part of the charm of artisan-crafted goods making each piece truly one-of-a-kind. This vase will compliment decorating styles such as Bohemian modern, cottage and contemporary as well as other styles with similar color schemes. It can be used as a floor vase or can be placed on bookshelves, a parson's table in an entryway or hallway, on the dresser in the bedroom and on coffee tables and side tables in the living room. It can be used to display dried flowers, leaves or decorative feathers and will also be beautiful on its own as a glistening accent piece. The use of this vase will add a touch of elegance to office reception areas, lobbies and powder rooms or any area of your home where you would like to add a pop of sparkling color or a sophisticated decorative accent in niches or nooks. It will be treasured as a housewarming gift or a wedding gift or a gift for another special occasion. Home stagers and interior decorators, whether home owners or professionals, will appreciate the marbled look and sparkle this piece will add to otherwise ordinary spaces. Cleaning Instructions: Dust with a dry cloth. Use non-abrasive cleaners only if necessary and only if sprayed on a cloth, not directly onto the vase. This handcrafted turquoise and silver vase made of iron with iridescent Arabesque-shaped glass mosaic tiles is exclusive to DecorShore, and is available for a limited time and in limited quantities in order that we may offer you fresh and new items on a regular basis.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614rhmamrHL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DecorShore","source_asin":"B07YLFZJBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YLFZJBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YLFZJBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
