window.products.push({"id":356586,"name":"Travel Vacuum Insulated Matte Stainless Steel Coffee Mug | Leak Proof Thermos Tumbler with Lid | Double Walled Metal Wine Cup (Black, 17 oz / 510 ml)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qjRyialcL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"A better Coffee/Wine cup means a lots Our vacuum insulated stainless steel travel coffee mug is made of premium 304 (18/8) edible food grade stainless steel. Unlike the normal plastic water bottles or single wall stainless flask. The double-walled construction leveraged the vacuum insulated theory. It efficiently blocks the air heats spreading from the cup's inside to the outside. It's the core of technology which judge whether a vacuum insulation tumbler is premium or not. For the both summer day and cold winter. This quality stainless steel insulated tumbler will be the best choice. There is no doubt a glass of cold water or iced wine can keeps you stay cool in hot summer. And a cup of warm tea or hot coffee will be your Intimate mate in a chilly winter. After the enjoying, you can just ease to put this dishwasher safe tumbler into the dishwasher. What convenient it is! However, a quality mug is necessary and makes you live better in many aspects. Specification Material: 304 (18/8) food grade stainless steel Capacity: 17 ounce (510 ml) Cup Mouth Diameter: 2.76 inches Height: 8.86 inches Instructions to Use 1. Please clean the water bottle body and components with neutral detergent before first time use. 2. For effectively extend the life of the thermos. We recommend not to put acid and corrosive liquids for a long time. Such a carbonated beverage. it causes corrosion to the metal, destroying the metal wall of the thermos bottle, leads the thermal insulation performance of the thermos bottle is degraded. 3. When using, add a small amount of heat/cold water to preheat/ precooling, and then the insulation/cooling effect will be better. 4. Do not place the bottle in the microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qjRyialcL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIQUO","source_asin":"B07SVP85F1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SVP85F1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SVP85F1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":356587,"name":"ZOES HOMEWARE 54\"x15\" Ironing Board Cover & Pad | 100% Cotton Cover and Pad with Aluminum Coating | Heat-Reflective Ironing Board with Elastic Edges S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TKTtYsA8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ZOES HOMEWARE BASIC IRONING BOARD COVER AND PAD 【MATERIAL】：The ZOES HOMEWARE ironing board cover is designed to speed up your ironing time with its heat reflective technology. Made from 100% breathable cotton, it ensures a wrinkle-free and smooth finish. The pad is constructed with three layers of composite pure cotton interlayer with varying densities, and the pure cotton cover is covered with thousands of aluminum foil dots. This design can increase your ironing efficiency by 30-50% by reflecting heat. 【SIZE】:ZOES HOMEWARE 15\"x54\" full size ironing board cover and pad is designed to fit full size ironing boards. The design of elastic edges allows it to fit ironing boards with lengths ranging from 50 to 56 inches and widths ranging from 13 to 17 inches. It's also quilted for extra protection and durability - no more wrinkled, scorched, or torn ironing board covers.Best for steam generator irons 【FEATHERS】:The high-density cotton padding can withstand up to 260 degrees without fading or warping, even after thousands of uses. Continuous ironing for more than 30 minutes will not scorch. The aluminum foil coating ensures 100% no staining. It's also quilted for extra protection and durability - no more wrinkled, scorched, or torn ironing board covers. Suitable for all kind of irons. 【NOTE】:(1) Please ensure that you select the appropriate size for your ironing board before placing your order. (2) To reduce our costs and selling price, we use a smaller package size. As a result, the product may have wrinkles upon arrival, but these can be easily removed by ironing. (3) The cloth cover does not have Velcro straps and instead uses elastic edges for easy attachment to the ironing board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TKTtYsA8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOES HOMEWARE","source_asin":"B0BMDZFB3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMDZFB3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMDZFB3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
