window.products.push({"id":356738,"name":"Stainless Steel Bento Lunch Box EXTRA LARGE. 3 Sections Holds Sandwich and Two Sides. Ecofriendly Durable Perfect LunchBox for Adults Office or Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BOnLFEKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For adults, transporting food for hours on end can be a challenge,  which is where our EXTRA LARGE 3 Section Ecofriendly Stainless Steel Lunchbox comes into the picture.  We use 100% top-grade stainless steel (304 series stainless steel) with a lifetime warranty that ensures durability and structure, no matter where you bring it.  This lunchbox will never rust or corrode, specifically engineered for food.  Ecofriendly, no chemicals, PVC, BPA, or lead was used in the making of the lunchbox. It was designed to be safe, healthy, and easy-to-clean, just for you!  Our lunch box is constructed of 100% METAL and designed to eliminate silicone and plastic gaskets, this lunch box is NOT LEAK-PROOF. Please do not use it to carry liquids or wet food!  Try our three-in-one container set to carry:  Sandwiches  Sides  Cooking materials  Salads  Pastas  And more!  This lunchbox is much bigger than the competitors, able to accommodate up to 8 cups of food. What Makes Us Different? Our stainless steel lunchbox comes with bonuses you won’t find with other listings: Cutlery: Enjoy an on-the-go spoon and fork that nestle perfectly into the ecofriendly lunchbox. Bigger than most competitors: With our lunch box you can hold up to 8 cups of food! That's almost 2 liters! and about double than other competitors. Top quality stainless steel: Specially designed for food and with a LIFETIME WARRANTY, we use 304 stainless steel (18/08) for our lunch box. Best of all: this lunchbox can be used for office, picnics. or storage. Both indoors and outdoors Product Dimensions: 9” X 6.7” X 2.5” Upgrade Your Lunching Experience Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BOnLFEKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bento Choice","source_asin":"B07HHD5KR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HHD5KR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HHD5KR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
