window.products.push({"id":356740,"name":"Geevon Atomic Wall Clock with Backlight, Auto-Set Digital Atomic Alarm Clock with Indoor Outdoor Temperature,Calendar,Moon Phase for Home Office Elder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DOYH4pZLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Atomic Clock with Indoor Outdoor Temperature 】Atomic wall clock with temperature monitor function,The Wireless outdoor sensor (included) transmits the outdoor temperature ( ° C /° F optional)to the large digital wall clock. Which means you can put them inside your patio, backyard, garden or courtyard,easily monitor outside conditions without going out. 【Enhanced Atomic Clock Technology】Atomic clock wall will always be accurate to within one second as it receives daily WWVB updates, just select your time zone at the setting buttons of the clock and turn on the DST if applicable. Automatically updates for daylight saving time,weekday,day,month,time,help you manage regular life. 【8.8'' Large Digital Wall Clock with 8S Backlight】Large atomic wall clock battery operated with an 8.8'' LCD TN high definition slim display, can simultaneously display date, time (12/24H), week,moon phase,indoor&outdoor temperature（° C/° F）,records the daily MIN & MAX data and display tendency.And the digits are big enough for easy-viewing. 【Atomic Alarm Clock with Snooze Function】Not only a Calendar and Thermometer, but also can be used as a loud alarm clock. When the alarm goes off,Geevon atomic wall clocks battery operated will send out a gradually ascending \"beeping\" sound to wake you up. Before the alarm stops itself, press the \"SNOOZE\" button to get an extra 5-minute nap. Perfectly designed for heavy sleepers. (NOTE: The alarm goes off for 2 minutes, and if there is no action during this period, it will no longer continue to alarm.) 【Digital Wall Clock & Desk Clock】Our atomic digital clock features 2 hanging holes and a kickstand, can not only be placed on the nightstand, but also hung on the wall. The bold, simple styled bezel of the clock gives it a modern look, with a classic feel. Perfect for any room in the house, office, bedroom, closet, classroom or living room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DOYH4pZLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geevon","source_asin":"B0BBYSX3L6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBYSX3L6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBYSX3L6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
