window.products.push({"id":356790,"name":"DULONG Commercial Electric Griddle Countertop Flat Top Griddle,Stainless Steel Restaurant Grill with Thermostatic Control for Kitchen BBQ(1500W 14\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m0BDXNFxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description This electric griddle grill adopts the international popular style,body make by good quality stainless steel,energy-saving and safety.It is the new electrothermal product which is designed and developed with advance technology,be provided with thermostat function,easy control.At just 12.6kg,space-saving and portable.With its energy efficient hotplate you get an even heat distribution of up to 300C on cooking surface,as well as accurate thermostats for ultimate control,so there¡¯s no excuse for not having perfectly done food every time,no matter what you¡¯re making.Built in grease channel and catch draws grease away from your food for easy cleanSplash guards protect the user and surrounding walls from hot grease and oil splatte Specification Type:electric griddle grillMaterial:Stainless Steel+IronVoltage:110VPower:1500WTemperature Range:122¡ãF to 572¡ãF (50¡ãC to 300¡ãC)Cooking Plate Dimension:14.2\"x 11.8\"Overall Dimension:14.0\"x15.0\"x8.2\"Weight:12.6kg Pay attention 1.The surface of the electric griddle is coated with a layer of protective oil and covered with a piece of oil paper.When using for the first time,wipe off the protective oil with a cloth.Apply a layer of cooking oil and start heating the machine.2.This baking trays are made of iron.Iron will turn black after using.Please apply a layer of cooking oil after using,otherwise it may rust.If the color has changed of the grill plate after use,that is normal,not a quality problem!3.Do not touch the electrical heating floor to avoid scald when you use this machine.4.You should take out the plug or switch the machine was stopped,it could avoid the issue happen.All safeguard maintain work should be in process after shut down the power supply.If the appears hitch,do not dismantle by yourself.5.There may be a small amount of smoke for the first time, it cause of there is water vapor in transit. After working for a while, the smoke will disappear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m0BDXNFxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DULONG","source_asin":"B08PBGQQMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBGQQMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBGQQMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
