window.products.push({"id":356844,"name":"YuQi 2PCS Christmas Faceless Gnomes Decorations for Home, Fall Harvest Thanksgiving Gnomes Plush Table Decor for Autumn Holiday Kitchen Thanksgiving D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y7J03NATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.The Harvest Festival (or Fall Festival) is a Traditional In America. Autumn is harvest season, which means not only remembering to thank God for your blessings, but also celebrating the harvest at the market and stocking up for winter. So we put many Fall Thanksgiving Day elements into the gnomes by color and design. Fall gnome bring good luck to family, but also a sign of our celebrating the harvest of autumn. 2.Mr and Mrs Fall Gnomes. Gnome which is also called Tomte or Nisse. They are reputed to safeguard the farming people against misfortune. They can bring good luck to family and are regarded as elves ushering fortune, love and health to home. Therefore, autumn harvest gnome not only as gifts for family and friends, but also as decorations for autumn party. 3.Unique Fall Design.It is a festival to celebrate the harvest in the golden autumn. The whole autumn harvest gnome are mainly the coffee-brown tone of the maple leaf. Both Mr and Mrs gnome wear maple leaf. Full of the breath of autumn harvest. The harvest colored gnomes with sunflower and maple leaf are perfect addition to our fall decor. 4.Fall Gnomes Decorations for Home. Unique autumn farmhouse tiered tray Decor. The fall gnomes are perfect size to place anywhere in our home and create an amazing harvest atmosphere decoration at farmhouse or office. Enjoy autumn harvest! 5.Unique Ideal Gifts for Autumn.Super cute fall gnome. Perfect for Fall decorations gift to families & friends or someone that collects, they will be love these guys! Their lovely appearance is very popular with kids, and it is also a good choice for kids gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y7J03NATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YuQi","source_asin":"B09JRVYHJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-356844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JRVYHJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JRVYHJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
